#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.1.rst:4
msgid "v5.1.1"
msgstr "v5.1.1"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.1.rst:6
msgid ""
"v5.1.1 brings OpenMV Viewer up to date with :doc:`OpenMV IDE 5.1.1 "
"<../ide/v5.1.1>`. On Apple Silicon Macs every bundled tool is now a native "
"arm64 build, so firmware updates and recovery keep working on macOS releases"
" that no longer include the Intel translation layer. Nothing changes on "
"Windows or Linux."
msgstr ""
"v5.1.1 memperbarui OpenMV Viewer agar setara dengan :doc:`OpenMV IDE 5.1.1 "
"<../ide/v5.1.1>`. Di Mac Apple Silicon, setiap alat yang disertakan kini "
"merupakan build arm64 native, sehingga pembaruan firmware dan pemulihan "
"tetap berfungsi pada rilis macOS yang tidak lagi menyertakan lapisan "
"terjemahan Intel. Tidak ada perubahan di Windows maupun Linux."

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.1.rst:15
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Di halaman ini"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.1.rst:18
msgid "What changed"
msgstr "Yang berubah"

#: ../../changelog/viewer/v5.1.1.rst:20
msgid ""
"**Native Apple Silicon tools** -- the flashing tools the Viewer uses for "
"firmware updates, recovery, and loading a ROM file system onto the camera "
"are now native arm64 builds on Apple Silicon Macs; the Intel builds failed "
"on recent macOS releases (`36d4d9cf615 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/36d4d9cf615>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Alat native Apple Silicon** -- alat flashing yang digunakan Viewer untuk "
"pembaruan firmware, pemulihan, dan memuat sistem file ROM ke kamera kini "
"merupakan build arm64 native di Mac Apple Silicon; build Intel gagal pada "
"rilis macOS terbaru (`36d4d9cf615 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/36d4d9cf615>`__)."

